<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Fale conosco</title>
  <style>
    :root { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #172033; background: #f3f6fb; }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { margin: 0; padding: 40px 16px; }
    main { max-width: 680px; margin: auto; padding: 32px; background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 12px 36px #14213d14; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 2rem; }
    p { color: #586174; line-height: 1.55; }
    form { display: grid; gap: 18px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    label { display: grid; gap: 7px; font-weight: 600; }
    input, textarea { width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #cbd3e1; border-radius: 8px; font: inherit; }
    input:focus, textarea:focus { outline: 3px solid #3977f533; border-color: #3977f5; }
    textarea { min-height: 150px; resize: vertical; }
    button { justify-self: start; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 13px 22px; background: #245fe5; color: white; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
    .errors { padding: 14px 18px; background: #fff0ef; border-radius: 8px; color: #a12620; }
    .errors ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; }
    @media (max-width: 560px) { main { padding: 24px 18px; } .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Fale conosco</h1>
    <p>Preencha os campos abaixo. Sua mensagem será enviada para nossa equipe.</p>
    <% if (errors.length) { %>
      <div class="errors" role="alert"><ul><% errors.forEach((error) => { %><li><%= error.msg %></li><% }) %></ul></div>
    <% } %>
    <form action="/contato" method="post">
      <div class="grid">
        <label>Nome<input name="nome" autocomplete="name" required value="<%= values.nome || '' %>"></label>
        <label>E-mail<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required value="<%= values.email || '' %>"></label>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <label>Telefone<input name="telefone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required value="<%= values.telefone || '' %>"></label>
        <label>Assunto<input name="assunto" required value="<%= values.assunto || '' %>"></label>
      </div>
      <label>Mensagem<textarea name="mensagem" required><%= values.mensagem || '' %></textarea></label>
      <button type="submit">Enviar mensagem</button>
    </form>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
